                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#e15759' fontname='Nunito Black' fontsize='12'>2. Buying a home is becoming harder</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Housing prices increased by an average of </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>4.22% per year</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> between 2013 and 2023, while mortgage interest rates also rose. Changes in the number of property transactions show how the housing market evolved during this period.</run>
