                  <zone fixed-size='646' forceUpdate='true' h='20313' id='25' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='66032' x='586' y='46354'>
                    <formatted-text>
                      <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#e15759' fontname='Nunito Black' fontsize='12'>3- Location makes the difference.</run>
                      <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Where you live matters. Municipalities closer to Barcelona tend to show a larger gap between housing price growth and income growth. Coastal location may also be associated with higher housing costs.</run>
                      <run fontalignment='0'>. </run>
                    </formatted-text>
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                      <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                      <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                      <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    </zone-style>
                  </zone>
                </zone>
                <zone h='20313' id='34' name='mapa (2)' show-title='false' w='32796' x='66618' y='46354'>
                  <layout-cache minheight='201' minwidth='201' type-h='scalable' type-w='scalable' />
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#e15759' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='2' />
                    <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='5' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='21232' id='37' type-v2='text' w='98828' x='586' y='66610'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#e15759' fontname='Nunito Black' fontsize='14'>Conclusion</run>
              <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='12'>Between 2013 and 2023, housing affordability worsened across the 47 Catalan municipalities analysed. Housing prices increased faster than income, and the estimated mortgage effort became higher.</run>
              <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='12'>However, this change was not the same everywhere. Municipalities closer to Barcelona tended to experience a larger gap between housing price growth and income growth.</run>
              <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#e15759' fontname='Nunito Black' fontsize='12'>Overall, housing became less affordable, especially in areas where housing prices grew faster than people&apos;s incomes.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#f1ce63' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='3' />
              <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='5' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#fefaf1' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='11116' id='38' type-v2='text' w='98828' x='586' y='87842'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontname='Nunito Black'>Scope and limitations</run>
              <run fontalignment='0'>
This analysis focuses on housing purchase prices, rental prices, income and estimated mortgage effort.
It does not include other household expenses such as utilities, maintenance, taxes, insurance, transportation or daily living costs.
Therefore, the indicators provide an estimate of housing affordability trends, not a complete measure of household living costs or financial capacity.
The results show associations and trends, not causal relationships.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='4371' id='15' type-v2='text' w='98828' x='586' y='1042'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#e15759' fontname='Nunito ExtraBold' fontsize='14'>Key findings</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
