          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='16070' id='68' type-v2='text' w='72840' x='586' y='17263'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='12'>Research question</run>
              <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='12'>How has housing affordability evolved across Catalan municipalities, and how does this evolution relate to income, demographic change and distance from Barcelona?</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin-top' value='5' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='16221' id='93' type-v2='text' w='72840' x='586' y='1042'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='12'>A home is becoming harder to afford</run>
              <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='12'>Housing is a basic necessity, yet accessing it has become an increasing challenge for many people in Spain. Housing prices influence where people can live, when they can become financially independent, and how much of their income they can allocate to other needs.</run>
              <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='margin-top' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin-right' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin-bottom' value='1' />
              <format attr='margin-left' value='0' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='32291' id='96' is-scaled='1' param='C:/Users/jejoc/Desktop/Ironhack/Final Project/2024-11-23_Mani_23N_5575_s-1-1620x1080-1-768x512.jpg' type-v2='bitmap' w='25988' x='73426' y='1042'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='6' />
