                    <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='12'>Housing is a basic necessity, yet accessing it has become an increasing challenge for many people in Spain. Housing prices influence where people can live, when they can become financially independent, and how much of their income they can allocate to other needs.</run>
